From 5b4dc4b22636e7a4796047849f9ad6ab6d1035e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SquadronConsult <michael@defense-dna.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 04:44:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] hw/misc: add SIL I2C and GPIO bridges

sil-i2c-bridge is an I2C target whose every bus event is answered by an
external model over a chardev. sil-gpio-bridge wires SoC GPIO pins to an
external model: guest-driven levels go out, external levels come in as pin
inputs, and a machine reset releases every pin.
